{"version": 1, "updated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:37Z", "items": [{"id": "feed-f4cf190a554c", "title": "早报｜iOS27正式推送/比亚迪高管：燃油车在中国没有未来/iPhone 18 Pro渠道降价900元，苹果称不干预", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1680097?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6aa88c3769aa8.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "搞笑", "旅行探店", "游戏", "爱范儿", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n苹果六大系统正式版发布，Siri AI 先以英语推出\n\n\n苹果回应 iPhone 渠道降价：第三方有定价权，售后规则不同\n\n\n豆包手机助手正式发布消费版，支持跨应用任务与授权记忆\n\n\n曝 Anthropic 选择纳斯达克，争取 10", "published_at": "2026-09-15T00:08:20Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f4cf190a554c.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5ef15eca2c49", "title": "OpenAI、Anthropic 再次发出「AI 末日」警告；小米澎程今日全国交付；Deepseek 灰度测试 AI 语音对话", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370228", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/8c/89/8c89b92c070265d2729927aa1b894d7a.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\nOpenAI 首席执行官：今年不会上市，不能冒哪怕 10% 杀死所有人的风险\n\n\nOpenAI 首席执行官 Sam Altman 在接受采访时表示，这家人工智能公司专注于解决围绕 AI 技术的安全担忧，今年不会上市。\n\n\nAltman", "published_at": "2026-09-13T00:22:31Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5ef15eca2c49.json", "engagement": 200, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-860b9caa5422", "title": "早报｜iPhone 18 Pro首批售罄，发货延至10月/OpenAI放弃今年上市/罗永浩评价野人先生冰淇淋「难吃」", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1679930?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6aa73b00a6667.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "旅行探店", "游戏", "爱范儿", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\niPhone 18 Pro 系列首批多平台售罄，部分型号发货延至 10 月\n\n\nGurman：iPhone Duo 有望成为苹果历史级产品\n\n\n智谱完成约 50 亿美元融资，主要用于下一代模型研发\n\n\n荣耀回应「魔法画报耽误拨打 120」争议：发帖与事实不符，不予追究\n\n\n黄仁勋重申：2030 年全球 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-14T00:09:32Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-860b9caa5422.json", "engagement": 200, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-8b5a1ba72a57", "title": "DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 发布；罗永浩狂喷苹果折叠屏：全是抄的；马斯克「无聊公司」融资 30 亿美元｜极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370157", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/02/46/02461570cef3be0765e22e7338d372d3.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\nDeepSeek V4.1 Flash 模型正式发布：全面超越 V4 Pro、原生多模态视觉理解，最高降价 60%\n\n\n9 月 10 日消息，深度求索今日正式发布DeepSeek V4.1 Flash", "published_at": "2026-09-11T00:31:05Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-8b5a1ba72a57.json", "engagement": 190, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-a638005545c3", "title": "马斯克提出AI安全新思路：与其等政府出手，不如让竞争对手互相\"找茬\"", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781794", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/2d2c81cf-6cfb-409d-898e-15ef35ae4751.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "健身", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "旅行探店"