 {"id": "feed-00e5c0464247", "title": "「AI Native 」不是魔法，「创业者」这三个字依旧厚重", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/369955", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/8d/4b/8d4b7696e8cd4896b3d4bbc46db8853e.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "上个月，我集中跑了一趟上海和深圳，也跟几位在 AI 前沿一线折腾的创业者深聊了几次。\n\n\n齐俊元的新产品干了半年，我问他这阶段最大的收获是什么，他说了句挺朴素的话：「真的伸手去干的时候，你会发现认真还是挺重要的。」\n\n\n这话听着很普通，事后却让我不断想起，放到当下的行业环境下看，也挺让人警醒的。\n\n\n3", "published_at": "2026-09-07T09:29:26Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-00e5c0464247.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-2b3ca53dd08e", "title": "圆桌：智能向实，产业向新——AI如何进入真实世界 | 36氪 2026产业未来大会", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3984496514759689?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260915/v2_cb8fce4ee8b94fe393cab7ecd812ac83@6301044_oswg97472oswg1265oswg841_img_jpg?x-oss-process=image/quality,q_100/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "旅行探店", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "2026年，产业投资进入深水区，资本、技术与产业加速融合，旧的投资逻辑不再使用，新的共识正在诞生。2026产业未来大会聚焦新周期机遇，共探产业未来与“中国之光”的诞生。", "published_at": "2026-09-15T10:11:43Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-2b3ca53dd08e.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-391916d2b60c", "title": "对话 Sharpa 李一帆：通用机器人要么全能，要么无能", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/369851", "image_url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ewz3sfllJmc9Yp3rr18YQ0w2Gyb9fwMOicDq8ZdDxofUicxhuJTfadAibTvibmPb5IoJVUvChum3QFbm2RsEYniclqr