": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "旅行探店", "游戏", "爱范儿", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\nGPT-6 发布后，最火的案例莫过于各种各样的 3D 网页。\n\n\n有人让 GPT-6 操作 Blender，从零捏一个人物模型；有人让它做各种可以旋转、拆解、交互的 3D 网页。其中传播最广的一个案例，是一套人体解剖网站。\n\n视频里，一个完整人体可以被层层拆开，肌肉、骨骼、血管和器官全部变成独立的 3D 部件，据称", "published_at": "2026-09-11T08:49:09Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:41:25Z", "body": "bodies/feed-e7c0dcd33226.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-699629f41235", "title": "8点1氪丨英伟达被调查；罗永浩连用7个“抄的”吐槽苹果折叠屏；欧洲央行将三大关键利率上调25个基点", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3978247601601280?f=rss", "image_url": null, "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "旅行探店", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "今日热点导览\n\n\nDeepSeek V4.1 Flash模型正式发布\n\n\n298项重要国家标准发布，涉及AI、半导体等\n\n\n苹果回应下架iPhone 17", "published_at": "2026-09-11T20:03:47Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-699629f41235.json", "engagement": 260, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-bcda126f7fd7", "title": "派早报：商务部回应美国 AI 蒸馏指控", "source": "少数派", "author": "少数派编辑部", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/114439", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/9/11/2026/article/de4bcb4c-3b24-6419-114e-5825e70d9878.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "少数派", "旅行探店", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "9 月 9 日，商务部官网发布新闻稿，介绍商务部新闻发言人就美发布中国人工智能企业对美蒸馏活动相关网络安全公告答记者问的情况。\n\n该问答指出，注意到美东时间 9 月 8", "published_at": "2026-09-10T22:58:54Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-bcda126f7fd7.json", "engagement": 240, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-27182dded7c7