280-80.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "旅行探店", "游戏", "科技", "网球"], "excerpt": "\nThe Steam Frame is a great way to game in virtual reality. I've been testing it for three weeks and I've played more VR games in that time than I have in many", "published_at": "2026-09-14T17:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-4061070588ad.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-466eae9f33bd", "title": "对话极壳创始人孙宽：年出货 3 万台后，外骨骼「全班第一」的成长和焦虑", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370150", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/f7/d2/f7d2d73e24f08503881ee9b15061b598.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "在刚刚结束的 IFA 柏林国际消费电子展上，几乎每家机器人公司的展台上，都会摆上一台可穿戴外骨骼设备。就像 10 年前，很多互联网新锐创业者都喜欢在办公桌上摆一台无人机。这既是对这个品类「前沿」的认可，也表露出某种对市场增长的看好。\n\n\n2025", "published_at": "2026-09-10T11:41:33Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-466eae9f33bd.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-47ccc0c26963", "title": "圆桌：新能源：后时代的深水淘金 | 36氪 2026产业未来大会", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3984491452824578?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260915/v2_680ee217eec341029717035142c49131@6301044_oswg103463oswg1265oswg841_img_jpg?x-oss-process=image/quality,q_100/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "投资", "旅行探店", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "2026年，产业投资进入深水区，资本、技术与产业加速融合，旧的投资逻辑不再使用，新的共识正在诞生。2026产业未来大会聚焦新周期机遇，共探产业未来与“中国之光”的诞生。", "published_at": "2026-09-15T10:11:43Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-47ccc0c26963.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-58b78d9fab49", "title": "给 AI 发外设，戴森派摄像头进嘴、绿联给充电宝开了扇窗", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370328", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/55/39/55395da829e878d5dfa0c0c91df462a0.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "游戏", "科技"], "excerpt": "AI 正在把所有硬件重新做一遍，这句话说了三年，这周轮到了一把牙刷。\n\n\n今天，IFA 柏林开展，一千九百个品牌都在不同角度展示自己的创新力，连戴森都掏出了一款牙刷来告诉行业，我也能用 AI 玩出花样，牙刷 Dyson CameraJe 刷头下藏着一颗 1 毫米的摄像头，每秒盯着你哪颗牙没刷干净。联想打造了个人智能体", "published_at": "2026-09-15T06:01:55Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-58b78d9fab49.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-6dcb0783b947", "title": "The Nicobo Robot Companion: Less Than a Tool, Much More Than a Toy", "source": "Nippon.com", "author": "", "url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/japan-topics/g02619/", "image_url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/ncommon/contents/japan-topics/3071421/3071421.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "travel", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Lifestyle", "Nippon.com", "en", "text", "travel", "旅行探店", "日语学习", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "Think of an “AI-equipped robotic companion” and you likely consider powerful, helpful devices to accompany you as you tackle the difficult tasks in life. But", "published_at": "2026-09-14T21:00:12Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-6dcb0783b947.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, 