ion_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "少数派", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "Apple 于 9 月 15 日凌晨正式发布 iOS 27、iPadOS 27、macOS 27 Golden Gate 和 watchOS 27 等系统的正式版。其中， iOS 27 不仅大幅改善了性能，还优化了 Liquid Glass 设计风格、并给", "published_at": "2026-09-15T07:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-befb38f3c833.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c12d83a7660a", "title": "The 30 Best Watches at the 2026 US Open", "source": "GQ", "author": "Oren Hartov, Cam Wolf", "url": "https://www.gq.com/story/best-watches-us-open-2026-3", "image_url": "https://media.gq.com/photos/6a91dfc58322a0a51b318ff7/master/pass/0828-Watches-of-the-Week-2.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "style", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["GQ", "Lifestyle", "en", "style", "text", "健身", "投资", "科技", "网球"], "excerpt": "There’s something about a major tennis tournament that makes people want to bring out their very best watches. Don’t get us wrong. We’re watching the tennis at", "published_at": "2026-09-14T18:10:25Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c12d83a7660a.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c99929b3ad45", "title": "怎样让不戴眼镜的人，愿意每天戴一副AI眼镜？|专访应用材料公司副总裁 Paul Meissner", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "罗嘉阳", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1679952?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/11-360x240.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "投资", "旅行探店", "爱范儿", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "过去两年，AI眼镜成了消费电子行业最拥挤的新赛道。\n\n\n不过，卖得最好的产品往往没有显示屏幕——它们通过摄像头、麦克风和扬声器感知环境、调用AI，外观也更接近普通眼镜；另一边，带显示的眼镜产品仍在处理重量、亮度、功耗、续航和近视适配等问题。\n\n\n既然语音已经可以完成不少交互，智能眼镜还需要一块屏幕吗？对于原本没有佩戴眼", "published_at": "2026-09-14T01:53:41Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c99929b3ad45.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-d037cf4eac30", "title": "知名PE合伙人斯坦福授课：AI 时代的钱到底流向了哪里？", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781769", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/198d4b37-419d-4164-8f86-42195e03da9c.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "健身", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "资深科技投资人、Altimeter Capital合伙人Apoorv Agrawal在斯坦福大学的最新授课中，深度拆解了当前3000亿美元AI生态的“倒三角”利益分配格局，并直言AI应用要想突破当前的盈利瓶颈，进军广告领域将是今年的重大事件。\n\n\n近期，在斯坦福大学的一场公开课程中，Altimeter", "published_at": "2026-09-15T03:19:15Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-d037cf4eac30.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-d13496bf68fd", "title": "AI 时代，「种草」这件事会变成什么样？", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/369962", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/c4/64/c4644faeba0995c919271e68515708b1.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n作者｜靖宇\n\n\n互联网时代，鲜有一个网站或者应用，能像小红书一样在不停的转换身份和功能的进化中，穿越周期。\n\n\n对于现在的网民来说，你几乎能在小红书上面搜索到各种小妙招。它还是攻略集宝鉴，哪里旅游不踩坑全部奉献给小伙伴。\n\n\n当然，没人能忘了，这是国内公认的「种草」平台，甚至，「种草」这两个字的本源，就来自小红书本身", "published_at": "2026-09-07T13:01:05Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-d13496bf68fd.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-de1ec99102b1", "title": "对话小宇宙 kyth：播客的护城河是真实，AI 无法取代的是人的立场", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370345", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/bf/47/bf47e9424fbbc0018956d8e6cd037639.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "搞笑", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n头图来源：小宇宙\n\n过去一年，播客被推到了内容行业的聚光灯下。\n\n\nB 站拿出 10", "published_at": "2026-09-15T07:10:42Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-de1ec99102b1.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-e54da5c7e6ea", "title": "AI 时代的「4399」，可把我玩嗨了｜AI 上新", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370227", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/71/e4/71e4ce700e5344b098cf88d8079ef9d1.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "打开 Pocket 的前十分钟，我以为自己打开了一个 Instagram 版的 4399。\n\n\n不久前，Meta 在美国正式推出了 Pocket。Pocket 的玩法很好理解，用户不用写代码，只要告诉", "published_at": "2026-09-12T13:03:04Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-e54da5c7e6ea.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-ecd223785134", "title": "IFA 2026 现场：下一代穿戴设备的本质，是把录音笔和摄像头戴在身上", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370007", "image_url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/gMNcZry2uCUtXVictoeSzicr3MEXstribqvfM8VqO54JCoLrjsbXV6iaQmBHXSduyrNadOianAsm0yRxNl33Xr5gABOGXQyULPD3RNh5e01qhiaKE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg#imgIndex=2", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "本文转载自 Hardwire，欢迎关注，共同看见硬件行业新风向 👇\n\n\n屏幕消失不是做减法，是把「显示」换成了「采集」。\n\n\n作者｜张勇毅\n\n\n编辑｜靖宇\n\nIFA 开幕前一天，小米在柏林把手环 11 端了出来。还是 1.72 英寸的屏幕，亮度从上一代的 1500 尼特提到 2000 尼特，国内 289 元起，9 月", "published_at": "2026-09-08T07:29:19Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ecd223785134.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f648a5da0ad8", "title": "传字节开发实时空间视频生成模型；微信内测「AI 社交」功能；华为小米同天发布折叠屏手机", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/369965", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/7b/88/7b881b35c114cb2ce3eefd6857067a31.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "旅行探店", "极客公园", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n消息称字节正开发实时空间视频生成 AI 模型：最快下个月发布\n\n\n9 月 7 日消息，据彭博社报道，字节跳动正准备推出一款实时空间视频生成 AI 模型。该模型计划最早于下月发布。\n\n\n知情人士指出，发布时间尚未最终确定，计划仍可能发生变动。\n\n\n据介绍，该模型基于字节跳动现有的电影级视频生成 AI 模型", "published_at": "2026-09-08T00:34:54Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-15T10:13:33Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f648a5da0ad8.json", "engagement": 190, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-449ecc4aa4a4", "title": "我们距离RSI还有多远？来自AI一线的观点", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781652", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d025a3a4-b25a-42ba-9d4f-4233aa3e923b.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "健身", "华尔街见闻", "游戏", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "AI递归自我改进（RSI）的时间表，正成为业界最具争议的核心命题。\n\n\n在播客主持人Dwarkesh Patel与三位AI研究者的深度对谈中，OpenAI联合创始人、现Thinking Machines首席科学家John", "published_at": "2026-09-13T11:15:22Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-13T17:00:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-449ecc4aa4a4.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-731994dd254b", "title": "智谱以零息+溢价转股形式融资50亿美元，主要用于算力基础设施与模型研发", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781656", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/1a7dff79-7cbe-4a2e-9559-ae1e3bed3458.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "健身", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "智谱9月13日公告，公司完成约50亿美元（人民币约335亿元）新一轮融资，由约20亿美元股份配售与约30亿美元零息可转债共同构成。距离上一次7月配售融资约40亿美元，时隔仅两个月。\n\n\n这是智谱自今年1月登陆港交所以来的第三次股权融资动作。从IPO到两次再融资，募资节奏持续提速，资金流向也高度一致——算力、模型研发与基", "published_at": "2026-09-13T10:59:37Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-13T17:00:14Z", "body": "bodies/feed-731994dd254b.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b01a643063f0", "title": "死敌罕见联手！马斯克、Aaltman支持Dario Amodei“全球放缓AI”呼吁", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781639", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d889e4ca-d375-46f4-95be-d7f49c37e9f1.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "健身", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "AI领域三大死敌，史上头一次站在了同一边——在一系列失控事件与末日预警接连冲击行业后，Anthropic、OpenAI与SpaceX的掌门人罕见联手，呼吁放缓人工智能开发步伐。\n\n\n周六，Anthropic首席执行官Dario", "published_at": "2026-09-13T02:05:57Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-13T10:11:36Z", "body": "bodies/feed-b01a643063f0.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c5052c3df33c", "title": "外滩大会：AI新人类，登场", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3980309439265793?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260912/v2_5abccdfab33540bfaa5645f4cbeb0c75@19153231_oswg10132977oswg2738oswg3134_img_png?x-oss-process=image/quality,q_80/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumb